                    {
                        "sense_id": "45ca4650-5005-3b48-bb88-f9eebdc7735b",
                        "entry_id": "f9c54c3b-5fac-3c04-b46c-398193bd3ade",
                        "glosses": [
                            "traditionele benaming voor verschillende soorten uilen uit de familie Strigidae"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "benadrukt dat het om nachtdieren gaat"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f7b8d133-d42e-3341-9bec-77365e11c297",
                        "entry_id": "f9c54c3b-5fac-3c04-b46c-398193bd3ade",
                        "glosses": [
                            "benaming voor nachtvlinders uit de familie Noctuidae"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "vlinders"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0984fa13-59f1-3f05-abc4-f17cbb55bdcf",
                        "entry_id": "f9c54c3b-5fac-3c04-b46c-398193bd3ade",
                        "glosses": [
                            "iemand die vooral 's-avonds en 's-nachts actief is"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a6b6e6ae-988d-4f09-a682-5a9340647b54",
                                "sense_id": "0984fa13-59f1-3f05-abc4-f17cbb55bdcf",
                                "text": "Als je een echte nachtuil bent kun je ook terecht op de boot. Zie hoe de stad schittert onder het warme licht van een zonsondergang of wacht tot Berlijn romantisch oplicht in het donker. Je kunt vervolgens een mooi feestje bouwen op een boot, of juist in alle rust dobberen over de ’s avonds stillere wateren."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "56c8652c-97c3-4bc6-ba3a-1654ae53a86f",
                                "sense_id": "0984fa13-59f1-3f05-abc4-f17cbb55bdcf",
                                "text": "Verander in een nachtuil om dit kleurrijke spektakel te bewonderen. In Hannover kun je namelijk genieten van de shows van de Internationale Vuurwerkwedstrijd. De locatie? Herrenhäuser Garten. Op het programma staan onder andere live muziek, theater en unieke acts. Later op de avond verzamelt het publiek zich in de groene tuinen om de creaties van teams van over de hele wereld te bekijken."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "de75d1d7-bd70-4643-8eea-b6c5c4c10767",
                                "sense_id": "0984fa13-59f1-3f05-abc4-f17cbb55bdcf",
                                "text": "De Britse studie met als titel 'Waarom nachtuilen intelligenter zijn'legt een verband tussen 'snoozen'en creativiteit, intelligentie en geluk."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ec9c17de-367e-4e4b-96ec-763f9d3927b3",
                        "source_entry_id": "f9c54c3b-5fac-3c04-b46c-398193bd3ade",
                        "source_sense_id": "45ca4650-5005-3b48-bb88-f9eebdc7735b",
                        "source_sense_description": "traditionele benaming voor verschillende soorten uilen uit de familie Strigidae",
                        "target_lang_word": "night-owl",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "night-owl",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b423fc33-e9b4-3d32-ba46-265be665fd03",
                                        "entry_id": "1d59465a-071c-33c8-a1c0-f8ea27cfb5c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of night owl."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a15f9dd-b24c-4e73-8ad5-2c2d8d136381",
                                                "sense_id": "b423fc33-e9b4-3d32-ba46-265be665fd03",
                                                "text": "Their Weapons like to Lightning, came and went: / Our Souldiers like the Night-Owles lazie flight, / Or like a lazie Threſher with a Flaile, / Fell gently downe, as if they ſtrucke their Friends."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c42782c-25bd-442b-bbfe-bb4d15255889",
                                                "sense_id": "b423fc33-e9b4-3d32-ba46-265be665fd03",
                                                "text": "The well imitated cry of the night-owl, too frequent a guest in the wilderness that its call should be a subject of surprise, seemed to be a signal generally understood among them; [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa92d684-fb62-408a-b097-34f7cd40b5eb",
                                                "sense_id": "b423fc33-e9b4-3d32-ba46-265be665fd03",
                                                "text": "Wild waileth the night-wind through turret and hall, / Where the spider weaveth the funeral pall, / And voice of old from the dead Past call, / While the night-owl responds from the crumbling old wall, / Tu-whit! the midnight is murky and drear— / Tu-whoo! the deed is a deed of fear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "738566a3-edde-4db3-8ede-97483ce79106",
                                                "sense_id": "b423fc33-e9b4-3d32-ba46-265be665fd03",
                                                "text": "There we should have waked the night-owl with a catch, had an owl been within hearing. The watchman did instead."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d6e11d4-5c6f-43aa-8134-8e74080aa6f6",
                                                "sense_id": "b423fc33-e9b4-3d32-ba46-265be665fd03",
                                                "text": "The night-owl,—a mug-shaped instrument, with an orifice in its side, through which a whistle is inserted,—when used, is partly filled with water, to give the tremulous owl-hoot sound."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ac09c71-b862-494b-93b8-3382c6e0d74d",
                                                "sense_id": "b423fc33-e9b4-3d32-ba46-265be665fd03",
                                                "text": "At the right was the piano, with a young lady seated, ready to play. Just before the curtain, and arranged in a semicircle, sat the juvenile orchestra,—Kitty with a tin trumpet; Jane with her night-owl filled with water and ready to pipe up; Julia with another bird, but having a different note; John with his drum, and Edward with his trumpet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7d8a79e-ed74-4194-b77d-6a59204e3198",
                                                "sense_id": "b423fc33-e9b4-3d32-ba46-265be665fd03",
                                                "text": "O the strange fascination of these half-known half-impassable swamps, infested by reptiles, resounding with the bellow of the alligator, the sad noises of the night-owl and the wild-cat, and the whirr of the rattlesnake, [...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20e55ae0-ed70-4aa4-a754-667d2c24e2c4",
                                                "sense_id": "b423fc33-e9b4-3d32-ba46-265be665fd03",
                                                "text": "From time to time, I called \"Kasim!\" at the top of my voice. But the sound died away among the tree-trunks; and I got no answer but the \"clevitt\" of a frightened night-owl."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
